{"time": 1770190287, "type": "recv", "message_id": "591092070", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3091099280"}, "sender": {"id": "3091099280", "name": "诶呀"}, "message": "“好久不见，各位”"}
{"time": 1770190331, "type": "recv", "message_id": "429944796", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3222503301"}, "sender": {"id": "3222503301", "name": "劇場愛歌"}, "message": "“两位小姐，好久不见。”我微笑着说，“没想到还能再次与你们相遇……诺顿先生呢？以及，许小姐身边这位是？”我提出疑问。"}
{"time": 1770190402, "type": "recv", "message_id": "378897043", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "2037978956"}, "sender": {"id": "2037978956", "name": "en"}, "message": "上前介绍自己“我是哈里，是徐小姐的朋友，是一名。。。。。。。。店员”"}
{"time": 1770190411, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2025355028", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "名取雅"}, "message": "“这是我的朋友，哈里，他身手比较厉害，这次的调查，我希望诺顿先生能允许我带上这位朋友一起”"}
{"time": 1770190432, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1532832171", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2025355028]诺顿先生显然不在"}
