{"time": 1771593893, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1660345423", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1059925119]虽然有些不愉快的卡顿之声，但在你的手上功夫过后，门终究还是顺利地打开了。只是与此同时，有一位在房子与街道间的邻居注意到了你们，他看起来显然很是疑惑"}
{"time": 1771594020, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1592104111", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "这是一位正在自己家门口照料植物的老人，他穿着花匠服，用抹布抹了抹汗后向你们走来“你们是？”"}
{"time": 1771594145, "type": "recv", "message_id": "670427168", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "2037978956"}, "sender": {"id": "2037978956", "name": "en"}, "message": "“我们是托马斯的债主，他之前欠了我们很多钱，还tm被抓进监狱了”"}
{"time": 1771594191, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1128741074", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "2037978956"}, "sender": {"id": "2037978956", "name": "en"}, "message": "“我本来去监狱找他要债的，没想到他还给我们玩起失踪了”"}
{"time": 1771594221, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2035251344", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3091099280"}, "sender": {"id": "3091099280", "name": "诶呀"}, "message": "“所以我们这次来找找他那些值钱的东西，就当还债了”"}
{"time": 1771594363, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1582798014", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "这老人张着嘴，看起来有些不可置信“警察允许吗？？况且，老头子我没记错的话这都有快十年了！怎么才来讨债啊？”"}
{"time": 1771594412, "type": "recv", "message_id": "456389096", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "一一"}, "message": "“我们花了些时间向警察申请，与其说来讨债，不如说我们是来找托马斯的”"}
{"time": 1771594427, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1577365720", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3091099280"}, "sender": {"id": "3091099280", "name": "诶呀"}, "message": "“这是上面的让办的，唉没办法”"}
{"time": 1771594434, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1402900269", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "一一"}, "message": "“听闻他失踪了，想着他会不会在自己家留下些什么线索”"}
{"time": 1771594453, "type": "recv", "message_id": "387248802", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "一一"}, "message": "（可以展示那个有警察标签的钥匙）"}
{"time": 1771594533, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1909560596", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "老人不置可否地点点头“失踪了？这么晚才来？这倒是无所谓了，不过你们打算什么时候处理这间房子？影响社区环境又没法打理，邻居们都等了好几年了！”"}
{"time": 1771594618, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2020103372", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "一一"}, "message": "*靠近老人轻声说“伯伯，这房子有发生过什么奇怪的事吗？有什么奇怪的人经常来这里吗？也许有这些线索警察们能快速介入处理”"}
{"time": 1771594633, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1216987966", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "2037978956"}, "sender": {"id": "2037978956", "name": "en"}, "message": "“什么这间房子不吉利吗？具体说说，鬼屋我可不能要，不然万一落得和诺特一样的下场”"}
{"time": 1771594662, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1640267461", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3091099280"}, "sender": {"id": "3091099280", "name": "诶呀"}, "message": "“对呀你说说有些什么不好的东西，我们也好和上面汇报一下加快处理速度”"}
{"time": 1771594683, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1260180603", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3091099280"}, "sender": {"id": "3091099280", "name": "诶呀"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;动画表情&#93;,file=78F15D585FE2916FBF3AB6E34A679F24.jpg,sub_type=1,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhQ-G-ETMuu4yuu0EBbkaBhjACVVdRjuVSD_Cij6rYG-mOiSAzIEcHJvZFCAvaMBWhCktSUxbNKKbTgTfBMyD2kVegJZeYIBAmd6&amp;rkey=CAMSMLt3JB-81J2oYRA58sVoStWF0EcETC9LTFCRa2I_7t-fnom9ctlPP_hA-PQUdlhyZA,file_size=10990]"}
{"time": 1771594806, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1171137179", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "老人挑了挑眉“什么吉利不吉利的，这么多年不管草坪都荒废成这样了看不见吗？！这还不影响社区环境吗！门窗什么的还都上了锁不许其他人入内打理…而且也就一开始还有些警官前来看看，现在早几年没见人了！”"}
{"time": 1771594830, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1235722374", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3222503301"}, "sender": {"id": "3222503301", "name": "劇場愛歌"}, "message": "（我去洗澡挂机一下）"}
{"time": 1771594858, "type": "recv", "message_id": "191208442", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "“还不好的东西，这屋主都被抓起来逃狱了能是什么好东西？”"}
