{"time": 1772368428, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1224152655", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3091099280"}, "sender": {"id": "3091099280", "name": "诶呀"}, "message": "*跟随"}
{"time": 1772368453, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1622070834", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3222503301"}, "sender": {"id": "3222503301", "name": "劇場愛歌"}, "message": "“我还是跟着你们好了。”跟上许司昤"}
{"time": 1772368528, "type": "recv", "message_id": "229247644", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "你们回到了记忆里那令自己略有些抗拒的街道，曾经吆喝着的小贩仍然存在，只是换了个人；再将目光看向科比特的老宅——“汽水俱乐部”五个闪着霓虹灯光的大字招牌赫然出现在你们眼前"}
{"time": 1772368637, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1030779422", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3091099280"}, "sender": {"id": "3091099280", "name": "诶呀"}, "message": "（哇塞）"}
{"time": 1772368684, "type": "recv", "message_id": "600485402", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "而曾经所熟悉的房屋显然已经被夷为平地，改造成了眼前更符合街区商业化发展的餐饮店"}
{"time": 1772368686, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1051605538", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "2037978956"}, "sender": {"id": "2037978956", "name": "en"}, "message": "“汽水，嗯，会不会有什么特殊的东西呢”"}
