{"time": 1772369129, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1268978340", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "店里此时客人并不多，顾客三三两两，却清一色的是年轻人；桌上摆着各种橙色/蓝色/黑色/透明/…的饮料。柜台则有一位反带着棒球的男青年，正熟练地调制着一杯绿色的汽水"}
{"time": 1772369148, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1328986766", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "（棒球帽（）"}
{"time": 1772369223, "type": "recv", "message_id": "345487577", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "还有一名在柜台外哼着小调的男青年，看起来比柜台里那位长得年轻一些，很是相像"}
{"time": 1772369249, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1063489186", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3091099280"}, "sender": {"id": "3091099280", "name": "诶呀"}, "message": "（给我来一杯血腥玛丽）"}
